feat(generators): Add multi-modal generation framework

Implement comprehensive generation modules for all EVAVO task types:

Generators Package:
- generators/video.py: Video generation, frame interpolation, animation
- generators/audio.py: Text-to-speech, music generation, sound effects
- generators/model_3d.py: 3D model synthesis, refinement, multi-format export
- generators/texture.py: PBR texture generation (diffuse, normal, roughness, metallic)
- generators/particles.py: Particle system generation and physics simulation
- generators/__init__.py: Unified generator API with digest-bound task execution

Backends Package:
- backends/comfyui_backend.py: ComfyUI service adapter (port 8188)
- backends/ollama_backend.py: Ollama LLM integration (port 11434)
- backends/kokoro_backend.py: Kokoro TTS service adapter (port 8000)
- backends/__init__.py: Backend service registry and health checking

Legacy Automation Consolidation:
- scripts/legacy_automation/consolidation.py: Script registry and migration guide
- scripts/legacy_automation/__init__.py: Package initialization

Architecture:
- Each generator implements digest-bound task validation framework
- Service backends provide abstraction for local services
- Legacy scripts preserved as reference and gradual migration pathway

